# The STATUS artifacts are machine-regenerated on every platform and gated by
# the CI status-drift job (regenerate + git diff). Pin them to LF so a Windows
# checkout (core.autocrlf=true) is byte-identical to CI (LF) — otherwise
# regeneration produces git-status noise with an empty diff (SPEC-023).
# Deliberately narrow: pinning only these two files avoids renormalizing the
# rest of the repo's CRLF working tree.
docs/STATUS.md  text eol=lf
docs/status.json text eol=lf
